WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.376
The partnership works as a connected system Daniel’s diary

00:00:03.468 --> 00:00:08.284
work affects decisions documents and other people’s accepted assignments

00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:14.455
These interfaces are connected responsibilities not a universal hierarchy

00:00:15.336 --> 00:00:18.810
Independent control room The independent control room has its

00:00:18.863 --> 00:00:23.928
own defined monitoring and service responsibilities Its involvement must

00:00:23.994 --> 00:00:28.376
be agreed for the relevant assignment Daniel cannot promise

00:00:28.415 --> 00:00:30.415
that the room will provide a service that it

00:00:30.428 --> 00:00:35.006
has not accepted Request identify the required owners obtain

00:00:35.072 --> 00:00:38.532
the separate decisions / acceptance update the controlled record

00:00:38.546 --> 00:00:43.876
check completion evidence Example dependency a business preference for

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:47.165
a physical lunch does not by itself establish protective

00:00:47.205 --> 00:00:53.797
input transport arrangements or accepted monitoring Existing afternoon arrangements

00:00:53.836 --> 00:00:58.928
do not automatically cover the proposed lunch Workbook §

00:00:58.981 --> 00:01:05.007
1 . 1 . 3 1.5 1.7.3 and 1.8

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:09.928
No extra command powers or guaranteed services are introduced
